Keep Marea is the center of political power in [[Geography/Althane/Salores/Toleros/index|Toleros]]. It's a multi-story stone-walled fort on an island in the center of Toleros' channel. It houses the currently presiding member of the [[Org/Althane/The Triptych|Triptych]] in the city, which at this time is [[People/Althane/Lady Grave|Lady Grave]].
